{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0001", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "少阴属心肾水火；多由太阴湿盛未治传入。附子自肾温通血脉可达心。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyin", "six_channel.taiyin", "herb.fu_zi"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c01", "evidence_quote": "病会跑到少阴去，是因为你在脾的时候没有治好，它才会进入少阴", "seg_from": 3, "seg_to": 9, "start_s": 16.59, "end_s": 58.78, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=16s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 16.59, "end_s": 58.78}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0002", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "少阴里寒湿盛，小便清白几乎无色，有别于热证黄赤。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c01", "evidence_quote": "所以小便出是摆一个，根本就一点颜色都没有", "seg_from": 66, "seg_to": 66, "start_s": 377.17, "end_s": 384.99, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=377s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 377.17, "end_s": 384.99}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0003", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "少阴禁发汗；脉微细沉数皆示里寒，误汗则伤津见咳与下利。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyin", "clause.shl.285"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c01", "evidence_quote": "少阴症出现的时候，因为是理寒湿，绝对不要用汉法", "seg_from": 162, "seg_to": 178, "start_s": 882.59, "end_s": 972.93, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=882s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 882.59, "end_s": 972.93}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "理=里；汉=汗", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0004", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "吐利而手足逆冷为阴盛死证（药食不受）；若反发热则尚有生机。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c02", "evidence_quote": "病人有吐有下利的时候哈，手脚是冰冷的", "seg_from": 285, "seg_to": 291, "start_s": 1593.29, "end_s": 1633.29, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=1593s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 1593.29, "end_s": 1633.29}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0005", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "麻黄附子细辛汤：麻黄二、炮附三、细辛二；合用则不走表发汗而入里利小便祛湿，兼固阳。", "entity_ids": ["formula.ma_huang_xi_xin_fu_zi_tang", "herb.xi_xin", "herb.ma_huang", "herb.fu_zi"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c03", "evidence_quote": "麻黄附子细心汤呢，麻黄二钱，如果是麻黄有两钱细心，有两钱泡附子能有三钱", "seg_from": 400, "seg_to": 422, "start_s": 2232.125, "end_s": 2387.11, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=2232s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 2232.12, "end_s": 2387.11}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "细心=细辛", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0006", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "大黄附子汤=麻黄附子细辛去麻黄换大黄，治寒实积滞；热实用承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_huang_fu_zi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c03", "evidence_quote": "遇到寒食的时候，我们就要用大黄附子泻心汤热食的时候，我们才会使用到成气汤", "seg_from": 453, "seg_to": 458, "start_s": 2564.685, "end_s": 2602.495, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=2564s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 2564.68, "end_s": 2602.49}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "寒食=寒实；成气=承气", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0007", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第302条：少阴病得之二三日，麻黄附子甘草汤微发汗；二三日无里证故可汗。麻黄须先煮去沫。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.302", "formula.ma_huang_fu_zi_gan_cao_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c03", "evidence_quote": "麻黄附子甘草汤为发，其汗，以二三日无理证，故为发汗", "seg_from": 460, "seg_to": 470, "start_s": 2609.625, "end_s": 2660.18, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=2609s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 2609.62, "end_s": 2660.18}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "理证=里证", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0008", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "附子汤重用炮附子，配人参白术茯苓芍药祛寒湿扶正；去人参加生姜即真武汤。", "entity_ids": ["formula.fu_zi_tang", "formula.zhen_wu_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c04", "evidence_quote": "你如果把人生换成生姜，就是增午汤", "seg_from": 549, "seg_to": 554, "start_s": 3129.295, "end_s": 3166.75, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=3129s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 3129.3, "end_s": 3166.75}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "人生=人参；增午=真武", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0009", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "桃花汤：下利便脓血、腹痛、小便不利；与大黄附子汤攻下方向相反，一涩一攻。", "entity_ids": ["formula.tao_hua_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c05", "evidence_quote": "下利不止者便脓血者桃花汤", "seg_from": 613, "seg_to": 626, "start_s": 3498.919, "end_s": 3584.914, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=3498s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 3498.92, "end_s": 3584.91}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0010", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "少阴吐利手足逆冷烦躁欲死→吴茱萸汤温胃降逆。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wu_zhu_yu_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c05", "evidence_quote": "吐的很重，手脚冰冷、烦躁，欲食者无足以汤组织", "seg_from": 637, "seg_to": 639, "start_s": 3642.769, "end_s": 3681.924, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=3642s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 3642.77, "end_s": 3681.92}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "无足以=吴茱萸；欲食=欲死", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0011", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "少阴下利咽痛胸满心烦→猪肤汤。", "entity_ids": ["formula.zhu_fu_tang", "clause.shl.310"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c05", "evidence_quote": "少阴病病人有夏利，有咽痛、心烦者诸敷汤", "seg_from": 656, "seg_to": 656, "start_s": 3759.749, "end_s": 3766.909, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=3759s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 3759.75, "end_s": 3766.91}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "夏利=下利；诸敷=猪肤", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0012", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "半夏散及汤：半夏、桂枝、甘草等分捣散；咽中痛、喉痈可含咽。", "entity_ids": ["formula.ban_xia_san_ji_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c05", "evidence_quote": "半夏桂枝、甘草治末哈各等分", "seg_from": 786, "seg_to": 801, "start_s": 4490.48, "end_s": 4576.895, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=4490s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 4490.48, "end_s": 4576.9}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0013", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "白通汤：葱白、干姜、生附子；通表里温肾阳止下利。利不止厥逆干呕烦则加猪胆汁人尿反佐。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_tong_tang", "formula.bai_tong_jia_zhu_dan_zhi_tang", "herb.cong_bai"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c06", "evidence_quote": "白通汤葱白好，干姜附子生的生用一枚附子", "seg_from": 827, "seg_to": 851, "start_s": 4695.35, "end_s": 4858.66, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=4695s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 4695.35, "end_s": 4858.66}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0014", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "白通加猪胆汁后：脉暴出者死，微续者生。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_tong_jia_zhu_dan_zhi_tang", "clause.shl.315"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c06", "evidence_quote": "卖爆粗者死为序者生", "seg_from": 890, "seg_to": 892, "start_s": 5090.71, "end_s": 5114.665, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=5090s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 5090.71, "end_s": 5114.66}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "卖爆粗=脉暴出；为序=微续", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0015", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "第316条真武汤：腹痛、小便不利、四肢沉重、自下利——有水气。腹痛用芍药+炮附；利甚去芍加干姜。", "entity_ids": ["formula.zhen_wu_tang", "clause.shl.316"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c06", "evidence_quote": "蒸午汤真午汤呢，它里面呢跟附子汤很接近", "seg_from": 951, "seg_to": 991, "start_s": 5466.22, "end_s": 5724.533, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=5466s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 5466.22, "end_s": 5724.53}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0016", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "少阴下利清谷多由太阴寒湿未治传入，中焦寒湿盛极；手足厥冷反映胃肠阳气败。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyin", "six_channel.taiyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c07", "evidence_quote": "少阴病是因为太阴病没治好才跑出来的", "seg_from": 1009, "seg_to": 1019, "start_s": 5819.368, "end_s": 5890.078, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=5819s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 5819.37, "end_s": 5890.08}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0017", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "通脉四逆汤即四逆汤倍干姜；主下利清谷、里寒外热、手足厥逆、脉微欲绝。", "entity_ids": ["formula.tong_mai_si_ni_tang", "formula.si_ni_tang", "herb.gan_jiang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c07", "evidence_quote": "你说我干姜一中就变通来四季汤，干姜减一半，变成四逆汤", "seg_from": 1104, "seg_to": 1104, "start_s": 6326.358, "end_s": 6330.893, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=6326s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 6326.36, "end_s": 6330.89}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "通来四季=通脉四逆", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0018", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "四逆散：炙甘草、枳实、柴胡、芍药。腹痛加炮附，咽痛去芍加桔梗，泄利下重加薤白。", "entity_ids": ["formula.si_ni_san", "herb.chai_hu", "herb.shao_yao"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c08", "evidence_quote": "用炙甘草籽石，还有还有柴胡跟芍药", "seg_from": 1141, "seg_to": 1145, "start_s": 6548.608, "end_s": 6585.033, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=6548s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 6548.61, "end_s": 6585.03}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "籽石=枳实", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0019", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "四逆散疏肝利胆、开气郁，可治胆结石胆胀；与四逆汤温阳救逆路径完全不同。", "entity_ids": ["formula.si_ni_san"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c08", "evidence_quote": "那这治那个四逆散呢变成我们来拿拿来治胆结石胆发炎的时候非常好", "seg_from": 1159, "seg_to": 1159, "start_s": 6672.248, "end_s": 6681.793, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=6672s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 6672.25, "end_s": 6681.79}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0020", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第320条：少阴得之二三日口燥咽干者，急下之，宜大承气。寒结则用大黄附子汤，勿混。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.320", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.da_huang_fu_zi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c09", "evidence_quote": "少阴病得之二三日口燥，咽干即下肢", "seg_from": 1233, "seg_to": 1265, "start_s": 7103.039, "end_s": 7301.389, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=7103s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 7103.04, "end_s": 7301.39}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "下肢=急下", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0021", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "下利不止而气色光鲜、舌苔黄厚者，反是热结旁流/燥屎，当攻下而非涩止。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c09", "evidence_quote": "下利不止的候候，看到那个气色怎么那么那么那么光鲜", "seg_from": 1255, "seg_to": 1256, "start_s": 7235.439, "end_s": 7244.184, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=7235s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 7235.44, "end_s": 7244.18}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-007.kp0022", "video_id": "shl-007", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第324条：饮食入口则吐、心中温温欲吐、手足寒、脉弦迟，胸中实（痰食），宜吐不可下。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.324"], "chapter_id": "shl-007.c09", "evidence_quote": "饮食入口则吐，心中闷温，就心中就是讲胃哈", "seg_from": 1271, "seg_to": 1275, "start_s": 7332.829, "end_s": 7372.554, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jkXQmLyPxmE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkXQmLyPxmE&t=7332s", "series": "shl", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 7少陰症", "start_s": 7332.83, "end_s": 7372.55}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
